# ABP Testing

## Test Project Types
- `*.Domain.Tests` - Domain layer unit tests
- `*.Application.Tests` - Application service tests
- `*.EntityFrameworkCore.Tests` - EF Core repository tests
- `*.MongoDB.Tests` - MongoDB repository tests

## Test Base Classes
- `AbpIntegratedTest<TModule>` - Full integration test
- `AbpApplicationTestBase<TModule>` - Application layer test

## Key Practices
- Use **Shouldly** for assertions
- Test both EF Core and MongoDB if module supports both
- Include permission, validation, and edge case tests
- Use data seeders for test data
- Naming: `MethodName_Scenario_ExpectedResult` or `Should_Behavior_When_Condition`
